## Summary

- align `getOptionValueSourceWithGlobals()` with `optsWithGlobals()` value precedence
- treat an ancestor value with an intentionally undefined source as still shadowing child values
- add regression coverage for parent overrides, explicit sources, and multi-level command ancestry

## Validation

- focused option-source tests — 11 passed
- `npm run test-all` — 1,359 passed, 5 skipped
- TypeScript and tsd checks — passed
- ESLint — passed
- Prettier — passed

Fixes tj/commander.js#2651.
